    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO121 · Chapter 5 · Session 24 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 24 — Submission of Individual Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13599 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO121 · Chương 5 · Buổi 24 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 24 — Submission of Individual Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13599 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">TU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">TU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Submission of Individual Assignment 1<br><br>Handout of Individual Assignment 2 (Chapters 30, 3, 31, 32, 33, 34)<br><br>Chapter 29: The Monetary System<br><br>[Practice: 1 period(s)]</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DN1</strong> — Julia can fix a meal in 1 hour, and her opportunity cost of one hour is $50. Jacque can fix the same kind of meal in 2 hours, and his opportunity cost of one hour is $20. Will both Julia and Jacque be better off if she pays him $45 per meal to fix her meals? Explain.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practise in the <a href=\"/exam?course=ECO121\">Exam Room — ECO121</a> (3 practice papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Luyện tại <a href=\"/exam?course=ECO121\">Phòng thi — ECO121</a> (3 đề luyện: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
